Usage: semaphore-cli config print <file> [flags]

Print the effective bootstrap file: defaults and environment overrides applied,
secrets redacted

Prints what the relay proxy would run with: the file after the SEMAPHORE_*
environment overrides and the defaults. Secrets, API keys and admin keys print
as [REDACTED]; references (fromEnv, fromFile) print as written. --effective is
required. Exit code 2 when the file is invalid.

Arguments:
  <file>    Bootstrap file to print.

Flags:
  -h, --help             Show context-sensitive help.
  -v, --version          Print the version and exit

  -o, --output="text"    output format: text or json (YAML for print)

      --effective        print the effective configuration (required)
